{"run_id": "phase2_smoke_g003_g010", "arm": "S2", "row_id": "G-010", "flow_bucket": "3_cross_company_comparison", "status": "answered", "http_status": 200, "output": "To compare Aurobindo Pharma and Dr. Reddy's Laboratories on total assets for the year ended 31 March 2025, we examine the \"TOTAL ASSETS\" figures from their respective consolidated financial statements.\n\nFor Aurobindo Pharma, the total assets as at March 31, 2025, are reported as 497,849.7 million Indian Rupees (INR).\n\nFor Dr. Reddy's Laboratories, the total assets as at March 31, 2025, are reported as 494,266 million INR.\n\nComparing the two figures, Aurobindo Pharma reports total assets of 497,849.7 million INR, while Dr. Reddy's Laboratories reports total assets of 494,266 million INR. The difference in total assets is calculated as follows:\n\n497,849.7 - 494,266 = 3,583.7 million INR.\n\nThus, Aurobindo Pharma reports total assets that are 3,583.7 million INR more than Dr. Reddy's Laboratories.\n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"numerical\",\n  \"answer_value\": 3583.7,\n  \"unit\": \"million INR\",\n  \"period\": \"year ended March 31, 2025\",\n  \"basis\": \"consolidated results\",\n  \"citations\": [\n    \"document_id=e97121aee57558adf2dc27d6770bec497df8a9cb4deeb37d67186abef5484ed2 page=205\",\n    \"document_id=bdd1b13a7b77a338641ee7aa03f94f105d1bd0f1f853ea6ea0986047a918a63c page=176\"\n  ],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"The total assets of Aurobindo Pharma for the year ended March 31, 2025, are 497,849.7 million INR, while Dr. Reddy's Laboratories report total assets of 494,266 million INR. The difference is 3,583.7 million INR.\"\n}", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 17160, "completion_tokens": 1534, "total_tokens": 18694}, "latency_ms": 35963, "context_pages": [["bdd1b13a7b77a338641ee7aa03f94f105d1bd0f1f853ea6ea0986047a918a63c", 176], ["e97121aee57558adf2dc27d6770bec497df8a9cb4deeb37d67186abef5484ed2", 205]], "rendered_prompt_hashes": ["520b0280064313255a54e1fa4ff6cc464ee98391dcefbeacff0