 million Indian Rupees. This figure is found in the balance sheet section of the document.\n\nFor Dr. Reddy's Laboratories, the total assets as of March 31, 2025, are reported as **494,266** million Indian Rupees. This figure is also found in the balance sheet section of their document.\n\nComparing these values, Aurobindo Pharma reports total assets of **497,849.7** million Indian Rupees, while Dr. Reddy's Laboratories reports total assets of **494,266** million Indian Rupees. Therefore, Aurobindo Pharma reports total assets that are higher by:\n\n$$\n497,849.7 - 494,266 = 3,583.7 \\text{ million Indian Rupees}\n$$\n\n{\n  \"answer_kind\": \"numerical\",\n  \"answer_value\": 3583.7,\n  \"unit\": \"million Indian Rupees\",\n  \"period\": \"year ended March 31, 2025\",\n  \"basis\": \"consolidated results\",\n  \"citations\": [\n    \"document_id=e97121aee57558adf2dc27d6770bec497df8a9cb4deeb37d67186abef5484ed2 page=205\",\n    \"document_id=bdd1b13a7b77a338641ee7aa03f94f105d1bd0f1f853ea6ea0986047a918a63c page=176\"\n  ],\n  \"abstain\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"The total assets for Aurobindo Pharma and Dr. Reddy's Laboratories are directly provided in their respective consolidated financial statements. Aurobindo Pharma reports higher total assets by 3,583.7 million Indian Rupees.\"\n}", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 5720, "total_tokens": 6247, "completion_tokens": 527, "prompt_tokens_details": null}, "latency_ms": 12234}], "majority_samples": 3, "score": {"gold_abstain": false, "pred_abstain": false, "abstain_correct": true, "false_answer": false, "false_abstention": false, "gold_answer_kind": "entity", "pred_answer_kind": "numeric", "numeric_match": null, "entity_match": true, "citation_valid": true, "parse_ok": true}, "score_v1": {"gold_abstain": false, "pred_abstain": false, "abstain_correct": true, "false_answer": false, "false_abstention": false, "gold_answer_kind": "entity", "pred_answer_kind": "numeric", "numeric_match": null, "entity_match": true, "citation_valid